{"name": "Fortunato", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"102\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/17e1b2fb88f8ee111b7a19a788913be1.avif?t=1787144544\" width=\"1126\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"112\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/339c73a4235c7fb83fb4bea123720411.avif?t=1787144544\" width=\"1126\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draw a pair of aces, use them as poker hands or to eliminate your opponents? A poker roguelike battle card game. Build a deck of jokers, defeat bosses, modify cards, and conquer challenges across the ever-changing islands. At the table of four, win by chips or remaining health, your call...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"112\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/20151d8f6f29e775ab42ef3d9a616560.avif?t=1787144544\" width=\"1126\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/1efeb1e2dd3021802444f4a2ae7daada.poster.avif?t=1787144544\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/1efeb1e2dd3021802444f4a2ae7daada.webm?t=1787144544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/1efeb1e2dd3021802444f4a2ae7daada.mp4?t=1787144544\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fortunato is a symbol of peace. It was originally created to put an end to the endless wars between the Fortunians, the inhabitants of the continent. Today, most conflicts must be settled through the game of Fortunato. No more violence, only cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"112\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/8aaddea2c29122a59481f0528a00d48a.avif?t=1787144544\" width=\"1126\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/6e9f843186dd5706d9d6b2ae330c6b5b.poster.avif?t=1787144544\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/6e9f843186dd5706d9d6b2ae330c6b5b.webm?t=1787144544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/6e9f843186dd5706d9d6b2ae330c6b5b.mp4?t=1787144544\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are two ways to win in Fortunato: either by having the most chips or by being the last player with health remaining. Choose how you want to win.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"112\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/b9922ab1ab5fbad0e8e4f9f138d53719.avif?t=1787144544\" width=\"1126\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/9fa214f48f72477f03349ffc8574a230.poster.avif?t=1787144544\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/9fa214f48f72477f03349ffc8574a230.webm?t=1787144544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/9fa214f48f72477f03349ffc8574a230.mp4?t=1787144544\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 4-players poker experience blended with deckbuilding and battle card gameplay. Use your poker hand not only to win chips from the pot, as in classic poker, but also to attack or defend against opponents. The game features familiar poker phases: betting, drawing cards, revealing the Flop, and the final showdown, with a twist of battle card assignment and match-up phase in-between the classic poker phases.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"112\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/25b39fbb748094ca441604099b3d0c22.avif?t=1787144544\" width=\"1126\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/e59f6e99804ccd96a46afc936f33fed7.poster.avif?t=1787144544\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/e59f6e99804ccd96a46afc936f33fed7.webm?t=1787144544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/e59f6e99804ccd96a46afc936f33fed7.mp4?t=1787144544\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The deckbuilding comes from Joker cards with various abilities that each player, including your opponents, can use. From a Joker that can reveal an opponent\u2019s current poker hand, to one that forces all players\u2019 poker hands to be redrawn, to another that adds additional shields in the match-up phase, and so on. Find the best combination of Jokers in your deck to beat your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/600e6713355da4c30c88f3cfff197f1b.webp?t=1787144544\" width=\"1126\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"112\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/d828bda64b4aa9a58af68d26205d9b1e.avif?t=1787144544\" width=\"1126\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2 to 4-players</strong> match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Constantly changing island layouts each run, with up to 4 islands, each featuring different levels and unique gimmicks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of <strong>room types</strong> in every island: regular matches, character challenges, bosses, special rooms, rest room, and shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various obtainable <strong>Jokers</strong> that can change the tide of the match: <strong>battle</strong>, <strong>poker</strong>, <strong>buff</strong>, and <strong>debuff</strong> cards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Joker cards</strong> can also be <strong>enhanced</strong>: upgrade the effect/ability to a better version, lessen the cost to activate, and duplicate the same Joker card.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Entertaining <strong>bosses</strong> at the end of each island, and you can even obtain their signature Joker.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Furry characters</strong> to defeat, each with their own personalized Joker deck, betting style, and battle tendencies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Passive-effect equipment in the form of <strong>Charms</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Variety\u00a0<strong>cosmetics</strong> for the table, card backs, bet napkins, and character portraits, featuring different animals or races, facial features, and clothing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And\u2026 <i>funny</i> <strong>stickers</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">accurate presentation if you gamble irl:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"48\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/34661dd80615c33beaeec1af24df7f59.webp?t=1787144544\" width=\"48\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"48\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/2c74681722b5b104f34d5366d55d3a4c.webp?t=1787144544\" width=\"48\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"48\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/fa235d266b17f000ab5520097fa91c49.webp?t=1787144544\" width=\"48\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">please, do not :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"102\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/extras/f185b565324c9d03a6ab1e2f7ecef5fc.avif?t=1787144544\" width=\"1126\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Draw a pair of aces, use them as poker hands or to eliminate your opponents? A poker roguelike battle card game. Build a deck of jokers, defeat bosses, modify cards, and conquer challenges across the ever-changing islands. At the table of four, win by chips or remaining health, your call...", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094030/85e5a69eb1f73421dd2e45e5614afbf87c7437fb/header.jpg?t=1787144544", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Strategy", "Card Game", "Card Battler", "Roguelike", "Deckbuilding"], "developers": "NORMALICE", "publishers": "NORMALICE", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4094030", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "30 April 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/rHLu8Uuf1vg", "first_seen": 1777500000.0, "review_rank": 757}